/P 170 0 R
/E (Affective computing occupies a genuinely useful niche in narrow, consensual applications such as accessibility tools, therapeutic support, and safety-critical drowsiness detection, while raising substantive concern the moment inference occurs without disclosure.)
/Pg 25 0 R
/K [21]
