/P 171 0 R
/E ( Enterprise networks no longer have a clear boundary. A single organization may depend on cloud services, connected devices, remote endpoints, and industrial systems at the same time. While this makes operations faster and more scalable, it also increases the number of paths through which an attacker can reach the system. [1])
/Pg 26 0 R
/K [10]
>>
endobj
