/K [12]
>>
endobj
541 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 171 0 R
/E ( At the center of a data-driven security framework is a large stream of information coming from many parts of an enterprise. Network logs, endpoints, IoT devices, cloud services, and other systems all contribute pieces of the security picture. Before this information can be analyzed, it needs to be collected, cleaned, normalized, and stored in a form that security tools can work with. [1][6])
/Pg 26 0 R
/K [13]
>>
endobj
