/E ( A model can learn what normal activity looks like and flag deviations that deserve attention. Security Information and Event Management \(SIEM\) systems add another layer by bringing security events together in one place, while Security Orchestration, Automation and Response \(SOAR\) platforms can automate parts of the response. [2])
/Pg 27 0 R
