548 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 172 0 R
/E ( Cloud and edge computing also matter because security data increasingly comes from distributed environments. Together, these technologies move cybersecurity toward a continuous cycle of monitoring, analysis, decision-making, and response rather than a purely reactive model. [1])
/Pg 27 0 R
/K [1]
>>
