/P 173 0 R
/T ( Machine learning also introduces its own uncertainty. A model can produce false positives, miss an attack, or behave differently when it encounters data that is unlike its training data. Complex models can also be difficult to explain, which becomes a problem when security teams need to understand why a particular alert was generated. [3])
/E ( Machine learning also introduces its own uncertainty. A model can produce false positives, miss an attack, or behave differently when it encounters data that is unlike its training data. Complex models can also be difficult to explain, which becomes a problem when security teams need to understand why a particular alert was generated. [3])
/Pg 28 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
569 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 173 0 R
/T ( Cost is another practical barrier. Effective data-driven cybersecurity requires infrastructure, specialized expertise, continuous maintenance, and regular model updates. Finally, collecting and analyzing large amounts of user and system data creates privacy concerns. Strong security therefore has to be balanced with responsible data handling and appropriate access controls. [4])
/E ( Cost is another practical barrier. Effective data-driven cybersecurity requires infrastructure, specialized expertise, continuous maintenance, and regular model updates. Finally, collecting and analyzing large amounts of user and system data creates privacy concerns. Strong security therefore has to be balanced with responsible data handling and appropriate access controls. [4])
/Pg 28 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
