/T ( Machine-learning-based Intrusion Detection Systems \(IDS\) are an important part of this approach. They examine network traffic and system logs for patterns that may indicate suspicious behavior. The process generally begins with data collection, followed by feature extraction, where useful characteristics such as traffic flow, protocols, or other system attributes are selected. [5])
/E ( Machine-learning-based Intrusion Detection Systems \(IDS\) are an important part of this approach. They examine network traffic and system logs for patterns that may indicate suspicious behavior. The process generally begins with data collection, followed by feature extraction, where useful characteristics such as traffic flow, protocols, or other system attributes are selected. [5])
/Pg 28 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
