/T ( The major advantage is adaptability. Instead of depending entirely on a fixed list of known attack signatures, machine-learning systems can learn patterns from data and potentially identify unusual activity that does not exactly match previously defined rules. That makes them particularly useful in environments where the threat landscape changes quickly. [5])
/E ( The major advantage is adaptability. Instead of depending entirely on a fixed list of known attack signatures, machine-learning systems can learn patterns from data and potentially identify unusual activity that does not exactly match previously defined rules. That makes them particularly useful in environments where the threat landscape changes quickly. [5])
/Pg 28 0 R
/K [7]
