/E ([2] Han, S., Mao, H., & Dally, W. J. \(2015\). Deep Compression: Compressing Deep Neural Networks with Pruning, Trained Quantization and Huffman Coding. arXiv preprint arXiv:1510.00149.)
/Pg 32 0 R
/K [8]
>>
