/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 1507 0 R
/E (The First Webcam Watched a Coffee Pot: In 1991, researchers at the University of Cambridge connected a camera to their network and pointed it at a coffee pot. The live feed allowed people to check if coffee was available without leaving their desks, making it one of the earliest uses of a webcam.)
/Pg 36 0 R
/K [3]
