3847 0 obj
<<
/Title (These features are used to train a model to distinguish normal activity from abnormal behavior. Once trained, the model can examine new information in real time and classify it accordingly. When the system detects something suspicious, it can generate an alert or trigger a corrective action.)
/Dest [28 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 3835 0 R
/Prev 3840 0 R
